{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Nebula Flow, your dog is guiding you through various musical realms. Follow its path by moving and jumping in sync with the music to fill your boost bar. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your boost regularly to clean the road or risk being overwhelmed by increasingly numerous obstacles.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get to the end of each song and complete its objectives to unlock more levels! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See how you stack up on the leaderboards\u2014beat your friends and rise through the ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feeling creative? Use the level editor to craft your own challenges and share them with the community on the Workshop.</p><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Supports keyboard, mouse, and gamepad. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Settings for audio latency available. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay elements colors can be customized. </p><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A game by Nico and Songe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pixel art by Daniel &quot;DanieruArt&quot; Reis and Krep_pxl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Original soundtrack by Songe.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I can show you the world","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2616170/1dffc24f6301209330ffd22eee7a20618ebdbf69.jpg"},{"name":"End of the road?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2616170/1dffc24f6301209330ffd22eee7a20618ebdbf69.jpg"},{"name":"Olympian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2616170/1dffc24f6301209330ffd22eee7a20618ebdbf69.jpg"},{"name":"I did my homework","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2616170/1dffc24f6301209330ffd22eee7a20618ebdbf69.jpg"},{"name":"Teacher's pet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2616170/1dffc24f6301209330ffd22eee7a20618ebdbf69.jpg"},{"name":"Metronome